// A page size that keeps ed_win_out's gfx_open call inside the
// w<=0||h<=0 guard (gfx_linux.c, gfx_open): asymmetric so a case built on it
// still catches a w/h argument swap, but neither dimension is positive
// enough to open a real window and start the frame loop.

win_bound_fixture() {
  ed_page(0, 99);
} return void;
():() then ed_w:(0)
():() then ed_h:(99)
